  <note>
    <title>게시판에서 수정시 나모 이미지 도메인이 없어진다면</title>
    <created>20151102T124833Z</created>
    <updated>20151102T125004Z</updated>
    <note-attributes>
      <author>bbb1sss2@gmail.com</author>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">

<en-note><div>enirsc.nsf/actionpublic15_MIME.js의</div><div><br/></div><div>아래 함수에서 도메인 변경</div><div>function changeBodylink() {<br/>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; //alert(document.forms[0].we.BodyValue);<br/>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; vBodyValue = document.forms[0].we.BodyValue;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br/>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; var regexp =/src=\&quot;\/eni/gi;<br/>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; orgBody = vBodyValue.replace(regexp,&quot;src=\&quot;http\:\/\/bm.agtech.kr\/eni&quot;);<br/>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; /*<br/>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; var regexp1 =/src=\&quot;http\:\/\/bm.gmb.co.kr/gi;<br/>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; orgBody = orgBody.replace(regexp1,&quot;src=\&quot;http\:\/\/mail.gmb.co.kr&quot;);<br/>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; */<br/>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; //alert(orgBody);<br/>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; document.forms[0].we.BodyValue = orgBody ;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br/>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>}</div><div><br/></div></en-note>      ]]>
    </content>
  </note>
