    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">

<en-note><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Default Sans Serif&amp;quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline !important; float: none;">http://www.ezhelp.co.kr</span><br style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Default Sans Serif&amp;quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Default Sans Serif&amp;quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Default Sans Serif&amp;quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline !important; float: none;">id : nano</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Default Sans Serif&amp;quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline !important; float: none;">pw : nano2045</span></div></en-note>      ]]>
    </content>
  </note>
  <note>
    <title>인쇄시 2번째 페이지 표 border 안나오는 이유</title>
    <created>20151126T033746Z</created>
    <updated>20151126T033959Z</updated>
    <note-attributes>
      <author>bbb1sss2@gmail.com</author>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">

<en-note><div align="left"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: 바탕;"><br/></span></span></div><div align="left"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: 바탕;"><br/></span></span></div><div align="left"><font face="바탕"><span style="font-size:12pt">&lt;META HTTP-EQUIV=&quot;X-UA-Compatible&quot; CONTENT=&quot;IE=8&quot;&gt;</span></font></div><div align="left"><font face="바탕" size="4"><span>이 메타 태그는 ie가 11버전이라도 ie8버전으로 호환성 보기를 강제로 실시함</span></font></div><div align="left"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 바탕;"><br/></span></span></div><div align="left"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 바탕;">현재 프린트페이지 css가 ie 11버전에서 호환이 안되는것이 있어서 border가 깨지듯함</span></span></div><div align="left"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 바탕;"><br/></span></span></div><div align="left"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 바탕;">프린트페이지 웹메인-&gt;printpreviewpagehidden ie8버전으로 강제 보기 실시</span></span></div><div align="left"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 바탕;"><br/></span></span></div><div align="left"><font face="바탕" size="4"><span style="line-height: 23px;">표 안깨짐!</span></font></div><div align="left"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 바탕;"><br/></span></span></div></en-note>      ]]>
    </content>
  </note>
  <note>
    <title>제목</title>
    <created>20160405T032932Z</created>
    <updated>20160405T032940Z</updated>
    <note-attributes>
      <author>bbb1sss2@gmail.com</author>
      <source-url>http://blog.syszone.co.kr/2898</source-url>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">

<en-note><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Xenserver와 Xendesktop을 통해 통합 데스크탑 환경을 구축하기 위해서는</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">아래 최소 사양의 host machine을 준비한다.</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">CPU : 4core (권장 8core)</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Memory : 4GB (권장 8GB)</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">HDD : 300GB &nbsp;(권장 500GB)</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">NIC : Gigabit 1 NIC (권장 2개)</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">전반적인 설치 과정은 아래와 같다.</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">해당 host machine 에 XenServer 5.6을 설치하고, 설치된 XenServer host에</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">vDmC, vController, vMaster 와 같이 3개의 VM을 생성한다.</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">vDmC 는 AD, DNS, DHCP 역할을, vController는 XenVM 세션 제어, VM 관리,</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">VM delivary 등의 역할을, vMaster는 사용자 데스크탑의 Master 이미지 역할</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">을 담당한다.</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">- XenDesktop 시스템 구성도</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">1. XenServer5.6 설치</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Citrix 사이트에서 다운받은 패키지(XD5_Express.zip) 중 XenServer-5.6.0-install-cd.iso</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">파일을 가지고 설치 CD를 만든다. 해당 CD를 가지고, host machine에 XenServer를 설치한다.</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">XenServer는 Redhat Enterprise 리눅스 기반의 임베디드 운영체제이다.</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">간단한 네트워크 정보등을 입력하면, 설치가 완료된다.</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">2. XenCenter 설치</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">XenCenter는 원격에서 XenServer를 관리할 수 있는 관리 콘솔 프로그램이다.</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">XenCenter를 통해 XenServer에 접속한 후 VM 생성 및 설정등을 수행할 수 있다.</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">XenServer-5.6.0-install-cd.iso 패키지 내에 Client 디렉토리내에 XenCneter를 설치한다.</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">3. VM 설치</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">XenCenter에서 XenServer에 연결한 후, 3개의 VM을 생성한다.</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">vDmC : windows 2008 Server R2 ( 최소 Windows 2003 Server)</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">vController : &nbsp;windows 2008 server R2 (최소 windows 2008 server sp2)</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">vMaster : windows 7 enterprise</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">4. 역할 설정 및 관련 프로그램 설치</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">설치 완료 후 아래 역할 관련 프로그램을 설치한다.</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">여기서 XenServerTool 은 XenCenter에서 각 VM의 현황 정보를 모니터링 할때 사용되는</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">프로그램을 설치를 해 두길 권장한다. (필수사항은 아님)</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">vDmC : XenServerTool, AD, DNS, DHCP</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">vController : XenServerTool, XenDesktop5,</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">vMaster : XenServerTool, XenDesktop(VDA)</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">5. 주의 사항</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">설치 시 총 3개 이상의 VM을 동시에 가동할 수 있는 host machine 사양을 준비해야함.</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">vDmC : core1, 1024MB memory, 24GB HDD</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">vController : core1, 1024MB memory, 24GB HDD</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">vMaster : core2, 2044MB memory, 24GB HDD</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">특히 HDD 디스크를 200GB 이상 구성하지 않을 경우, 초기 셋팅 자체를 못할수도 있다.</div><div style="font-family: NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, ngttf, ngeot, dotum, 돋음, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div>운영까지를 고려한다면, 500GB 이상의 HDD를 준비하길 권장한다.</div></div></en-note>      ]]>
    </content>
  </note>
