n-x:0%;background-position-y:0%;border-bottom-color:#d4d0c8;border-left-color:#d4d0c8;border-right-color:#d4d0c8;border-top-color:#d4d0c8;color:#000000;cursor:auto;direction:ltr;display:table-cell;float:none;font-family:굴림, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;list-style-image:none;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin:auto;margin-bottom:auto;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:auto;min-height:auto;min-width:auto;outline:#000000 0px none;padding:1px;padding-bottom:1px;padding-left:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-top:1px;table-layout:auto;text-indent:0pt;text-transform:none;vertical-align:auto;visibility:inherit;white-space:normal;word-spacing:normal;">정양범:1. 복수 견적을 통해 최저가 공급업체를 우선 선정하였습니다. 2. 터빈 상부 베어링은 필요한 시점으로 인해 공급 가격과 납기일을 함께 고려하여 업체를 선정하였습니다.(현재 필요한 수량 4개는 최저가가 아니지만 최단 납기 가능 업체를 선정하였습니다.)</td></tr><tr style="background-position-x:0%;background-position-y:0%;border-bottom-color:#d4d0c8;border-left-color:#d4d0c8;border-right-color:#d4d0c8;border-top-color:#d4d0c8;color:#000000;cursor:auto;direction:ltr;display:block;float:none;font-family:굴림, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;list-style-image:none;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin:auto;margin-bottom:auto;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:auto;min-height:auto;min-width:auto;outline:#000000 0px none;table-layout:auto;text-indent:0pt;text-transform:none;vertical-align:auto;visibility:inherit;white-space:normal;word-spacing:normal;"><td colspan="1" nowrap="false" rowspan="1" style="background-position-x:0%;background-position-y:0%;border-bottom-color:#d4d0c8;border-left-color:#d4d0c8;border-right-color:#d4d0c8;border-top-color:#d4d0c8;color:#000000;cursor:auto;direction:ltr;display:table-cell;float:none;font-family:굴림, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;list-style-image:none;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin:auto;margin-bottom:auto;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:auto;min-height:auto;min-width:auto;outline:#000000 0px none;padding:1px;padding-bottom:1px;padding-left:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-top:1px;table-layout:auto;text-indent:0pt;text-transform:none;vertical-align:auto;visibility:inherit;white-space:normal;word-spacing:normal;">배경환: 1. 2014년 12월 동일 품목 구입실적 있으며, 실적금액은 다음과 같습니다. 1) 터빈 상부 베어링 ￦115,000/EA 2) 터빈 하부 베어링 ￦153,000/EA 3) 커플링 베어링 ￦6,000/EA 2. 커플링 베어링은 삼성중공업 실증시험중 소손이 발생되어 정격회전속도 15,000 rpm 에서 29,000 rpm 으로 사양 변경함에 따른 단가 인상이 되었으며, 터빈 베어링은 납기에 따른 견적이 다양하여 필요 우선순을 고려하여 최적의 업체들로 선정 하였습니다</td></tr><tr style="background-position-x:0%;background-position-y:0%;border-bottom-color:#d4d0c8;border-left-color:#d4d0c8;border-right-color:#d4d0c8;border-top-color:#d4d0c8;color:#000000;cursor:auto;direction:ltr;display:block;float:none;font-family:굴림, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;list-style-image:none;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin:auto;margin-bottom:auto;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:auto;min-height:auto;min-width:auto;outline:#000000 0px none;table-layout:auto;text-indent:0pt;text-transform:none;vertical-align:auto;visibility:inherit;white-space:normal;word-spacing:normal;"><td colspan="1" nowrap="false" rowspan="1" style="background-position-x:0%;background-position-y:0%;border-bottom-color:#d4d0c8;border-left-color:#d4d0c8;border-right-color:#d4d0c8;border-top-color:#d4d0c8;color:#000000;cursor:auto;direction:ltr;display:table-cell;float:none;font-family:굴림, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;list-style-image:none;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin:auto;margin-bottom:auto;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:auto;min-height:auto;min-width:auto;outline:#000000 0px none;padding:1px;padding-bottom:1px;padding-left:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-top:1px;table-layout:auto;text-indent:0pt;text-transform:none;vertical-align:auto;visibility:inherit;white-space:normal;word-spacing:normal;">조의제:품질에 집중하세요</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div style="background-position-x:0%;background-position-y:0%;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-color:#000000;border-top-color:#000000;color:#000000;cursor:auto;direction:ltr;display:block;float:none;font-family:Gulim;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;list-style-image:none;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin:auto;margin-bottom:auto;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:auto;min-height:auto;min-width:auto;outline:#000000 0px none;table-layout:auto;text-indent:0pt;text-transform:none;vertical-align:auto;visibility:inherit;white-space:normal;word-spacing:normal;">&nbsp;</div></div></div><p style="background-position-x:0%;background-position-y:0%;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-color:#000000;border-top-color:#000000;color:#000000;cursor:auto;direction:ltr;display:block;float:none;font-family:Gulim;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:18pt;list-style-image:none;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin:1px auto;margin-bottom:1px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:1px;min-height:auto;min-width:auto;outline:#000000 0px none;table-layout:auto;text-indent:0pt;text-transform:none;vertical-align:auto;visibility:inherit;white-space:normal;word-spacing:normal;"/><div style="background-position-x:0%;background-position-y:0%;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-color:#000000;border-top-color:#000000;color:#000000;cursor:auto;direction:ltr;display:block;float:none;font-fam